00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:27.520
i always say hollywood but i don't say hollywood&nbsp;
as in the location i call like the industry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:31.680
hollywood so the longer you've been in hollywood&nbsp;
