00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:06.800
you know when pilot season is going on and&nbsp;
you're not supposed to reach out right and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:11.360
so it's just because you know how the industry&nbsp;
works you've been in the industry a long time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:15.360
you know that there's a pilot season you know&nbsp;
that people are really busy during pilot season&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:21.280
but there's always going to be an exception to&nbsp;
that rule that rule is not really set in stone&nbsp;&nbsp;

